    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dream Family Home Ready to Walk Into\n\nThis exceptional family home is one of the finest properties to come to the market in the Ballina area in many years. Presented to the highest standard both inside and out, this spacious residence offers luxurious family living in a peaceful countryside setting.\n\nThe beautifully manicured gardens are bursting with colour and enjoy magnificent views of the Nephin Mountains and the surrounding countryside. Conveniently located just a short drive from Ballina town, with local school bus services passing the door, this property combines rural tranquillity with everyday convenience.\n\nAccommodation & Features\n4 spacious bedrooms, all en-suite\n2 elegant living rooms\nSeparate dining room\nLarge kitchen with utility room off it\nLarge double garage with excellent potential for many uses or conversion\nAir circulation system installed in 2023\nNew Bord na Móna septic tank installed in 2015\nBuilt in 2001\nGarden shed to the rear\nOil-fired central heating\nFully alarmed\nAll contents negotiable\nSite area: c. 0.19 hectares\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in a highly desirable location, offering space, comfort, and stunning countryside views."
      },
